[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3556996207","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112954#issuecomment-3556996207","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112954","id":3556996207,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UA3Rv","user":{"login":"TheDying0fLight","id":95179191,"node_id":"U_kgDOBaxRtw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95179191?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDying0fLight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-20T10:02:11Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T18:50:33Z","body":"(Note I added a second shader to the MRP of the issue which isn't built-in)\r\nI found that the runtime sends error messages with the relevant issues (first line is the language it detects and what string it uses to detect it, second line is the message and data received from the runtime):\r\n<img width=\"1127\" height=\"50\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aa312305-9b94-4e32-a40a-8515602efbba\" />\r\n<img width=\"1112\" height=\"52\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dad3219d-1d33-4d0e-a68d-4d01f1f248c3\" />\r\n\r\n~Now I have two issues gdshader doesn't seem to be a registered language so it isn't detected and the built-in shader doesn't have have a gdshader extension, so would then still not be detected. Next I will look into registering gdshader or just adding it directly in the language check in~ https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7716a4cba0e4d96e170488bd4f332d22395f7bdb/editor/debugger/script_editor_debugger.cpp#L676-L684\r\n~And for the built-in shader I was thinking if a shader is the only option to get a .tscn error and maybe that could also be interpreted as a gdshader, otherwise the data from the runtime probably needs to contain more information~","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3556996207/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3562842161","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112954#issuecomment-3562842161","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112954","id":3562842161,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UXKgx","user":{"login":"TheDying0fLight","id":95179191,"node_id":"U_kgDOBaxRtw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95179191?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDying0fLight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-21T12:34:14Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T18:50:27Z","body":"~Also thinking about making a proposal (haven't yet looked in-depth if this was already proposed):\r\nA well thought out `open_file_in_editor` (or something alike) function which generalizes opening files of all kinds of types (with the internal and external editor) would be helpful as I found multiple local implementations which would benefit from this ([_meta_clicked](https://github.com/TheDying0fLight/godot/blob/93ed59890d40e08730e141c3d7dbd3d550150469/editor/editor_log.cpp#L208) and [_on_find_in_files_result_selected](https://github.com/TheDying0fLight/godot/blob/93ed59890d40e08730e141c3d7dbd3d550150469/editor/script/script_editor_plugin.cpp#L3974))~","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3562842161/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3571749596","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112954#issuecomment-3571749596","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112954","id":3571749596,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7U5JLc","user":{"login":"TheDying0fLight","id":95179191,"node_id":"U_kgDOBaxRtw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95179191?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDying0fLight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T16:44:40Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T18:50:08Z","body":"~Note: On startup the error files are opened before the previously open files in the Shader Editor are recovered. This causes the error files to be on top of the file list (even if they weren't in the previous session), but in my opinion this is fine.~","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3571749596/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5414338397","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112954#issuecomment-5414338397","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112954","id":5414338397,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQrg_XQ","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist